{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control gravity in this first-person, 3D physics-based, puzzle-platformer to reach the end of each trial. The early trials (Tier 1 levels) are simpler with limited gravity control with later trials (Tier 2+) providing more challenge and freedom. You'll be sure to have your navigation and problem-solving skills put to the test. You can also take on a number of bonus levels such as races and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.poster.avif?t=1761652143\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.webm?t=1761652143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.mp4?t=1761652143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAVIT includes a number of other gameplay features  such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freezing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects can be frozen, locking them in place so that they are no longer affected by gravity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Negation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark tiles will prevent you from switching gravity. It's always a good idea to think twice before stepping on them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Zones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity zones allow you to change the level's gravity without affecting yourself. This can be used to open certain doors or lift platforms to new locations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powered Doors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These doors require the player to find an energy cube in order to open them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Pads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are buttons which will require the player to land on them with sufficient speed to activate.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collectables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself and extra challenge and locate the collectable orbs hidden throughout each level. As well as giving you a sense of accomplishment, a certain number is required to progress to the second more difficult tier of trials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available for Tier 1 levels, hard mode requires the player to navigate the levels in new ways to collect all of the energy orbs before the exit portal will spawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the game with another player in local split-screen, with independent or shared gravity control. Dedicated cooperative levels are in development and will be added at a later date.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3288390?t=1761652143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3288390?t=1761652143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/aa9ffca32a476537a5fb7ed88877d34ab89025b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761652143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/aa9ffca32a476537a5fb7ed88877d34ab89025b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761652143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3780090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control gravity in this first-person, 3D physics-based, puzzle-platformer to reach the end of each trial. The early trials (Tier 1 levels) are simpler with limited gravity control with later trials (Tier 2+) providing more challenge and freedom. You'll be sure to have your navigation and problem-solving skills put to the test. You can also take on a number of bonus levels such as races and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.poster.avif?t=1761652143\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.webm?t=1761652143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.mp4?t=1761652143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAVIT includes a number of other gameplay features  such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freezing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects can be frozen, locking them in place so that they are no longer affected by gravity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Negation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark tiles will prevent you from switching gravity. It's always a good idea to think twice before stepping on them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Zones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity zones allow you to change the level's gravity without affecting yourself. This can be used to open certain doors or lift platforms to new locations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powered Doors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These doors require the player to find an energy cube in order to open them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Pads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are buttons which will require the player to land on them with sufficient speed to activate.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collectables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself and extra challenge and locate the collectable orbs hidden throughout each level. As well as giving you a sense of accomplishment, a certain number is required to progress to the second more difficult tier of trials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available for Tier 1 levels, hard mode requires the player to navigate the levels in new ways to collect all of the energy orbs before the exit portal will spawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the game with another player in local split-screen, with independent or shared gravity control. Dedicated cooperative levels are in development and will be added at a later date.</p>","developers":["OnyxPawGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/0f1f523e4e5afc4a2aa64d628ec84abb468ad859/header.jpg?t=1761652143","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3288390/837288898/e6f1b07d0759bbeb1836c4a581d595d3915ff8cf/1753951794/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753956275","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3288390/837288898/e6f1b07d0759bbeb1836c4a581d595d3915ff8cf/1753951794/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753956275","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3288390/837288898/e6f1b07d0759bbeb1836c4a581d595d3915ff8cf/1753951794/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753956275","id":257148332,"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app